<chapter xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude">
  <title>Resource Links</title>

  <p>
    Here are some resources to help you learn more about <pretext />.
  </p>

  <sidebyside width="98%">
    <tabular top="minor" bottom="minor" left="minor" right="minor" valign="top">
      <col width="23%"/>
      <col width="77%"/>
      <row>
        <cell><p><url href="https://pretextbook.org"><pretext /> Homepage</url></p></cell>
        <cell><p>The <pretext /> homepage is a great place to start learning more about the project and its capabilities. It includes links to documentation, help forums, and more.</p></cell>
      </row>
      <row>
        <cell><p><url href="https://pretext.plus"><pretext /> Plus</url></p></cell>
        <cell><p>The <pretext />Plus is a website for creating, editing, and publishing simple <pretext/> Documents. Think of it as an early beta version of Overleaf, but for <pretext />.</p></cell>
      </row>
      <row>
        <cell><p><url href="https://pretextbook.org/doc/guide/html/guide-toc.html"><pretext /> Guide</url></p></cell>
        <cell><p>The <pretext /> Guide is a general resource for learning how to setup and use <pretext />.</p></cell>
      </row>
      <row>
        <cell><p><url href="https://groups.google.com/g/pretext-announce"><pretext /> announcements</url></p></cell>
        <cell><p>Stay updated on the latest news and developments in the <pretext /> community. Include information about drop-in office hours via Zoom.</p></cell>
      </row>
      <row>
        <cell><p><url href="https://mathtech.org">MathTech</url></p></cell>
        <cell><p>Explore the MathTech website for additional resources and information about <pretext />.</p></cell>
      </row>
      <row>
        <cell><p><url href="https://www.youtube.com/@MathTechOrg/videos">Video Tutorials</url></p></cell>
        <cell><p>Watch tutorial videos and presentations about <pretext />.</p></cell>
      </row>
      <row>
        <cell><p><url href="https://pretextbook.org/community.html">Help &amp; Support Forums</url></p></cell>
        <cell><p>The <pretext /> Help Forums are a great place to ask questions, share your work, and connect with other members of the <pretext /> community.</p></cell>
      </row>
      <row>
        <cell><p><url href="https://discord.gg/pretext">Discord Server</url></p></cell>
        <cell><p>Join the <pretext /> Discord server for real-time discussions and support.</p></cell>
      </row>
      <row>
        <cell><p><url href="https://runestone.academy/">Runestone Academy</url></p></cell>
        <cell><p>Runestone Academy is a hosting platform for <pretext /> authored textbooks.</p></cell>
      </row>
    </tabular>
  </sidebyside>

</chapter>